SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 11:31:31 and reappears at 12:39:25 CEST\, s
 een from Munich\, DE.\nThe Moon is 6° up in the ESE · daylight\, Sun +41
 °.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view a
 t the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.1374&l
 on=11.5755
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.1374&lon=11.5755
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
